WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:39.079
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:39.349 --> 01:41.643
[Episode 38]

3
01:48.040 --> 01:53.719
Zi Yi, I came because Father knows you won't see him.

4
01:53.719 --> 01:57.666
He asked me to give you something.

5
02:11.673 --> 02:15.012
[Pay the bearer five hundred silver dollars]

6
02:28.480 --> 02:31.680
What's this supposed to mean? He's dividing up the estate?

7
02:40.120 --> 02:42.040
Father's getting old.

8
02:42.040 --> 02:44.670
Things change by the day now.

9
02:44.670 --> 02:49.253
Nanjing is on edge, and the Japanese keep closing in.

10
02:50.880 --> 02:55.400
He fears that one day things will fall apart and he won't be able to protect us.

11
02:55.400 --> 02:56.500
So...

12
02:57.200 --> 03:01.633
He's sorted out all the liquid assets and overseas properties in his name.

13
03:02.300 --> 03:06.220
One share is mine. This one is yours.

14
03:06.880 --> 03:08.113
Father said

15
03:09.520 --> 03:15.320
these will keep us comfortable for the rest of our lives, wherever we go.

16
03:27.080 --> 03:30.753
Zi Yi, what's on your mind?

17
03:33.360 --> 03:37.273
Tell me.

18
03:38.080 --> 03:44.553
Have I... been wrong all along?

19
03:45.920 --> 03:47.400
What do you mean?

20
03:51.800 --> 03:56.425
All these years, from the moment I woke up,

21
03:56.425 --> 04:00.780
all I thought about was revenge and hate.

22
04:02.120 --> 04:06.006
I hated Yu Chang Xuan, hated Ye Ping Jun,

23
04:07.240 --> 04:08.905
hated Father.

24
04:11.520 --> 04:14.580
I felt like every one of them had wronged me.

25
04:17.800 --> 04:19.269
You silly girl.

26
04:21.399 --> 04:24.426
Stop dwelling on all those unhappy memories.

27
04:26.120 --> 04:28.593
From now on, live however your heart desires.

28
04:29.680 --> 04:34.346
Father and I will always be here for you.

29
04:59.680 --> 05:04.300
Xiao Yu Er, Mommy's here.

30
05:07.680 --> 05:11.766
Xiao Yu Er, Mommy's come for you.

31
05:18.560 --> 05:20.153
Xiao Yu Er.

32
05:25.560 --> 05:27.853
Mommy's taking you home.

33
05:33.600 --> 05:36.033
You were so little.

34
05:37.000 --> 05:38.366
Ping Jun,

35
05:40.880 --> 05:42.880
can you hear me?

36
05:53.420 --> 05:54.833
Jiang Xue Ting.

37
05:57.960 --> 06:00.640
Jiang Xue Ting, it's all your fault.

38
06:00.640 --> 06:03.990
If not for you, my baby wouldn't have left me.

39
06:03.990 --> 06:09.486
He wouldn't have left me. He wouldn't have died. Jiang Xue Ting!

40
06:12.519 --> 06:16.093
Xiao Yu Er, it's all my fault.

41
06:18.320 --> 06:19.893
It's all my fault.

42
06:21.040 --> 06:22.493
It's all my fault.

43
06:25.225 --> 06:26.600
Xiao Yu Er.

44
06:26.600 --> 06:27.880
Ping Jun.

45
06:27.880 --> 06:30.080
- Let go of me. Let go. - Ping Jun.

46
06:30.080 --> 06:31.640
- Let go! - Ping Jun!

47
06:31.640 --> 06:33.860
Dr. Zhao, come in.

48
06:35.266 --> 06:36.639
- Calm her down. - Sedative.

49
06:36.639 --> 06:38.013
Coming.

50
06:38.680 --> 06:42.060
- Let go of me... Xiao Yu Er. - Madam, calm down.

51
06:42.060 --> 06:43.593
Hurry.

52
06:44.440 --> 06:45.820
Hurry!

53
07:27.520 --> 07:30.153
Director Jiang, are you all right?

54
07:31.100 --> 07:32.433
Dr. Zhao.

55
07:34.759 --> 07:37.033
I don't care what it takes.

56
07:38.680 --> 07:40.966
Don't let her hurt herself again.

57
07:43.160 --> 07:46.720
The sedative only calms Miss Ye down for now.

58
07:46.720 --> 07:50.360
But once it wears off, she still won't be able to get past this.

59
07:50.360 --> 07:56.279
Not only will she hurt herself, I'm afraid she may even take her own life.

60
07:56.279 --> 08:01.580
So you're saying I should just watch her die?

61
08:04.760 --> 08:08.000
Perhaps we could try this.

62
08:08.000 --> 08:10.946
It's stronger than a regular sedative.

63
08:13.319 --> 08:14.506
This is...

64
08:16.114 --> 08:17.293
Medina.

65
08:39.800 --> 08:40.986
Chief.

66
08:42.440 --> 08:44.680
Where is the Commander-in-Chief going? To the Commander-in-Chief's residence?

67
08:44.680 --> 08:47.744
The Commander-in-Chief is going to the cemetery in the western suburbs.

68
08:47.744 --> 08:50.360
The cemetery? Who is he paying respects to?

69
08:50.360 --> 08:52.087
The Commander-in-Chief didn't say.

70
08:52.087 --> 08:55.533
He's often gone there alone lately and won't let anyone follow.

71
08:58.120 --> 08:59.206
I see.

72
10:01.759 --> 10:02.919
Master Chang Xuan?

73
10:17.640 --> 10:22.573
[In Memory of Our Beloved Daughter Ye Ping Jun]

74
10:41.539 --> 10:43.199
It was you.

75
10:50.480 --> 10:52.173
Why did you do it?

76
10:55.519 --> 10:57.366
What did she ever do wrong?

77
10:58.908 --> 11:02.113
Her only fault was being born in troubled times.

78
11:02.899 --> 11:08.926
The Battle of Nanping was life or death. This wasn't just between father and son.

79
11:09.798 --> 11:11.546
One wrong move,

80
11:11.546 --> 11:15.480
and the Yu Army and all of Nanhuai would have been doomed.

81
11:15.480 --> 11:21.080
But you knew how much she meant to me, and you just stood by and watched me suffer.

82
11:22.724 --> 11:25.680
If I hadn't agreed to the Jun family's terms,

83
11:25.680 --> 11:29.105
the lives of over a hundred thousand men

84
11:29.105 --> 11:31.560
and the legacy of generations of the Yu family

85
11:33.480 --> 11:35.438
would all have been destroyed.

86
11:35.438 --> 11:38.679
- Stop making excuses for your own selfishness. - Master Chang Xuan.

87
11:38.679 --> 11:40.206
Don't stop him.

88
11:49.160 --> 11:55.106
If killing me will make you feel better, then go ahead and shoot.

89
11:58.779 --> 12:00.900
But listen carefully.

90
12:02.080 --> 12:04.573
Even if I could do it all over again.

91
12:05.320 --> 12:10.100
Your old man would make the exact same choice.

92
13:10.820 --> 13:12.006
Hurry.

93
13:13.960 --> 13:15.160
Hold her down.

94
13:16.587 --> 13:18.200
Give her the shot and calm her down.

95
13:18.200 --> 13:19.260
All right.

96
13:48.040 --> 13:53.280
Xue Ting, I may not say anything, but that doesn't mean I don't know.

97
13:53.280 --> 13:57.786
You're Zi Yi's husband. How can you just ignore her like that?

98
13:58.838 --> 14:00.133
You're right.

99
14:00.720 --> 14:05.320
I came with you to see the Japanese today purely for Zi Yi's sake.

100
14:05.320 --> 14:07.680
This is your last chance.

101
14:07.680 --> 14:11.866
If you treat her like this again, don't expect me to treat you like family.

102
14:15.680 --> 14:17.027
I know.

103
14:18.000 --> 14:21.686
I'll make more time for her from now on.

104
14:26.039 --> 14:29.406
Father, I won't be going in with you.

105
14:30.012 --> 14:33.833
After all, I work for the government, and my position is sensitive.

106
14:34.800 --> 14:38.259
If I go in with you, people might talk.

107
14:42.077 --> 14:45.594
[Greater East Asia Co-Prosperity Cooperation Agreement]

108
14:47.240 --> 14:53.101
Gentlemen, our proposal for Greater East Asia Financial Co-Prosperity

109
14:53.101 --> 14:57.680
is fully backed by Japan's banking system.

110
14:57.680 --> 15:03.280
If you agree to convert your banks' reserves into our military scrip

111
15:03.280 --> 15:06.440
and open up exchange rights,

112
15:06.440 --> 15:12.123
the Empire guarantees that your assets will not only be safe,

113
15:12.123 --> 15:14.620
but will double.

114
15:16.290 --> 15:20.920
Mr. Fujiwara, let's be frank.

115
15:20.920 --> 15:22.280
You call this cooperation?

116
15:22.280 --> 15:24.280
This is daylight robbery.

117
15:24.280 --> 15:29.279
You force us onto military scrip to strip us of our hard currency.

118
15:29.279 --> 15:35.533
Opening up exchange rights is just a way to push Sujing's currency out of circulation.

119
15:35.533 --> 15:37.666
If I sign this today,

120
15:37.666 --> 15:41.274
Sujing's prices, its people's livelihoods, even its entire financial lifeline

121
15:41.274 --> 15:44.039
will be completely in your hands.

122
15:44.039 --> 15:49.770
You want to take control of our finances and destroy Sujing completely.

123
15:49.770 --> 15:52.490
You want to use this place as your cash machine. Am I right?

124
15:52.490 --> 15:54.336
Then let me make this clear.

125
15:54.336 --> 15:57.379
It's absolutely out of the question. I will not sign.

126
15:57.379 --> 15:59.899
We're not doing this deal.

127
16:03.259 --> 16:07.179
Taro, quiet. Settle down.

128
16:07.179 --> 16:11.033
Be good. Don't scare the guests.

129
16:16.200 --> 16:20.193
The Qingshi Town plan is going very smoothly.

130
16:20.820 --> 16:23.133
By poisoning the wells,

131
16:23.133 --> 16:28.146
over 300 villagers there have all been wiped out.

132
16:29.145 --> 16:34.120
Qingshi Town exists for the Empire of Japan's weapons testing.

133
16:34.120 --> 16:36.930
It's all necessary.

134
16:36.930 --> 16:43.360
The Japanese trading company plans to build a supply transfer hub.

135
16:43.360 --> 16:47.200
It connects several major trade routes.

136
16:47.200 --> 16:51.520
This place will become the chokepoint for all northern freight.

137
16:51.520 --> 16:55.679
The Qingshi Town railway branch, warehouse construction,

138
16:55.679 --> 17:00.533
and a permit for a private militia.

139
17:11.880 --> 17:15.800
This is what happens to those who refuse the Empire's friendship.

140
17:15.800 --> 17:19.159
President Tao, don't you get it yet?

141
17:20.000 --> 17:26.259
Seeing as you're the ringleader here and Director Jiang's father-in-law,

142
17:26.259 --> 17:29.800
I'm willing to give you one more chance.

143
17:37.700 --> 17:43.366
I have spent my life in business. I'm no saint.

144
17:43.366 --> 17:49.023
I've broken plenty of promises, and I'd sell anyone out for a profit.

145
17:49.023 --> 17:54.051
But I know full well that I am Chinese.

146
17:54.051 --> 17:57.440
In business, anything goes.

147
17:57.440 --> 18:00.257
Debts and grudges, fight over them all you like.

148
18:00.257 --> 18:01.720
But...

149
18:01.720 --> 18:07.672
the nation's cause and the blood of our ancestors are a line I will not cross.

150
18:07.672 --> 18:11.864
I will never betray my ancestors.

151
18:11.864 --> 18:13.226
So,

152
18:14.040 --> 18:19.299
if you want me to sell out my country and be your Japanese lapdog,

153
18:19.299 --> 18:21.366
you're dreaming.

154
18:25.480 --> 18:29.960
Mr. Fujiwara, I see no point in continuing this talk.

155
18:29.960 --> 18:33.366
Let's leave it here. Goodbye.

156
18:36.800 --> 18:39.680
- You... - You animal!

157
18:39.680 --> 18:41.500
You shameless bastard!

158
18:41.500 --> 18:47.860
Mr. Tao, if you change your mind now, I'll still welcome it.

159
18:53.720 --> 18:56.720
A puny little island nation

160
18:56.720 --> 19:01.400
daring to lay its hands on China.

161
19:01.400 --> 19:06.359
You're nothing but monkeys in fine clothes.

162
19:06.359 --> 19:08.619
Pathetic clowns.

163
19:10.520 --> 19:14.099
You warmongers

164
19:14.099 --> 19:19.426
will pay in blood one day.

165
19:26.120 --> 19:30.277
You demons. You devils.

166
19:30.277 --> 19:33.120
You will be on your knees.

167
19:34.080 --> 19:37.046
You shall surrender!

168
19:51.989 --> 19:53.160
Are you insane?

169
19:53.160 --> 19:57.333
We agreed to only talk business today. Why did you kill him?

170
20:20.420 --> 20:26.379
He controlled the financial lifeline of Sujing.

171
20:28.440 --> 20:30.299
How could you kill him?

172
20:30.299 --> 20:34.480
Mr. Jiang, calm down.

173
20:34.480 --> 20:36.613
This pains me too.

174
20:37.779 --> 20:43.220
But they hold these positions and refuse to serve the Empire.

175
20:43.220 --> 20:45.319
If they don't die,

176
20:45.319 --> 20:50.160
how can those willing to cooperate take their place?

177
20:50.160 --> 20:54.133
The Empire needs people who obey.

178
21:14.099 --> 21:15.493
Wait.

179
22:26.660 --> 22:28.006
You're back.

180
22:31.880 --> 22:33.306
What's wrong?

181
22:37.880 --> 22:39.486
Come, sit down.

182
22:45.440 --> 22:46.960
You're bleeding.

183
22:48.120 --> 22:49.940
What happened?

184
22:54.600 --> 22:57.774
Where's my father? Didn't he go with you?

185
22:59.045 --> 23:00.479
Your father...

186
23:02.440 --> 23:05.621
Say something! Where's my father?

187
23:05.621 --> 23:08.033
Say something. Where's my father?

188
23:11.940 --> 23:13.240
Zi Yi.

189
23:14.880 --> 23:16.207
Your father...

190
23:18.400 --> 23:20.100
He's gone.

191
23:22.880 --> 23:24.526
What do you mean, gone?

192
23:25.760 --> 23:27.479
What are you talking about?

193
23:28.420 --> 23:30.446
What do you mean, gone?

194
23:35.600 --> 23:38.566
Because he refused to cooperate with the Japanese,

195
23:40.280 --> 23:42.526
they killed him.

196
24:31.080 --> 24:33.133
- Zi Yi. - Let go of me.

197
24:33.760 --> 24:36.364
- Zi Yi. - Let go of me, Jiang Xue Ting.

198
24:36.364 --> 24:39.440
I'm going to kill those animals.

199
24:39.440 --> 24:40.880
Let go.

200
24:40.880 --> 24:44.483
They killed my father. I'll make them pay.

201
24:44.483 --> 24:46.280
Zi Yi, calm down.

202
24:46.280 --> 24:48.440
How can I calm down?

203
24:48.440 --> 24:52.906
My father died today, and nobody knows why.

204
24:52.906 --> 24:55.040
His blood is still on your clothes.

205
24:55.040 --> 24:58.680
Tell me, where were you when he called for help?

206
24:58.680 --> 25:00.560
Where were you!

207
25:00.560 --> 25:04.820
Let go of me. I'm going to kill them. Let go.

208
25:05.520 --> 25:08.048
- Let go! - Listen to me.

209
25:08.048 --> 25:11.160
You think you can avenge your father by rushing off to kill a few Japanese?

210
25:11.160 --> 25:12.386
Let me tell you,

211
25:12.386 --> 25:16.277
you'll only give the Japanese a bigger excuse to seize your father's life's work.

212
25:16.277 --> 25:20.453
And your uncle's family. You think the Japanese would spare them?

213
25:23.819 --> 25:28.440
They'll treat this gun of yours as a Chinese provocation.

214
25:28.440 --> 25:32.446
It'll go all the way to Nanjing. It'll become political.

215
25:33.840 --> 25:35.926
No one will be able to protect you then.

216
25:36.840 --> 25:39.273
Is that what your father would've wanted?

217
26:01.812 --> 26:04.480
I hate how useless I am.

218
26:04.480 --> 26:07.580
I hate that there's no justice in this world.

219
26:09.720 --> 26:11.300
Jiang Xue Ting.

220
26:12.654 --> 26:17.306
My heart feels like it's breaking apart.

221
26:31.360 --> 26:32.566
I know.

222
26:33.560 --> 26:35.046
I know.

223
26:37.339 --> 26:38.793
Don't worry.

224
26:39.799 --> 26:44.379
I will make them answer for this.

225
27:11.320 --> 27:12.966
Eat something.

226
27:28.480 --> 27:30.839
If your father were still here,

227
27:32.280 --> 27:34.513
he wouldn't want to see you like this.

228
27:35.200 --> 27:37.706
He loved me so much.

229
27:40.040 --> 27:43.093
And yet, over a man,

230
27:43.840 --> 27:47.006
I was ready to disown my own father.

231
27:49.440 --> 27:52.833
I wouldn't even go see him one last time.

232
27:54.320 --> 27:55.840
Now,

233
27:57.080 --> 28:02.833
I know exactly who killed him, and I can't do a thing about it.

234
28:07.760 --> 28:09.533
Jiang Xue Ting,

235
28:10.800 --> 28:14.160
how did the two of us end up like this?

236
28:15.800 --> 28:19.073
We were never like this before.

237
28:19.880 --> 28:22.500
Why is all of this happening?

238
28:24.640 --> 28:25.886
Why?

239
28:29.000 --> 28:30.226
Why?

240
29:30.200 --> 29:31.440
Ping Jun.

241
29:33.160 --> 29:36.103
Father's gone.

242
29:39.440 --> 29:42.006
He refused to work with the Japanese.

243
29:42.840 --> 29:47.326
They killed him.

244
29:58.840 --> 30:01.346
My sister and I have already decided.

245
30:01.920 --> 30:04.400
Once Father's funeral is over,

246
30:04.400 --> 30:08.646
we'll leave for France and never come back.

247
30:12.040 --> 30:16.113
I came here today to say goodbye.

248
30:39.120 --> 30:40.453
Ping Jun,

249
30:42.120 --> 30:43.406
I'm sorry.

250
30:44.520 --> 30:49.120
I've owed you an apology all along.

251
31:36.160 --> 31:37.860
Miss.

252
31:37.860 --> 31:40.019
- Send these there first. - Yes, Miss.

253
32:15.160 --> 32:16.853
You've really decided to leave?

254
32:18.400 --> 32:21.560
The tickets to France are booked.

255
32:21.560 --> 32:23.366
My sister and I are leaving together.

256
32:26.240 --> 32:28.120
Father's gone.

257
32:28.120 --> 32:32.800
There's nothing left here worth staying for.

258
32:32.800 --> 32:35.933
All that remains is pain.

259
32:37.840 --> 32:41.446
I think it's time to escape this life.

260
32:47.720 --> 32:49.120
Take care.

261
32:54.720 --> 32:56.046
You too.

262
33:10.560 --> 33:11.860
Jiang Xue Ting.

263
33:17.520 --> 33:20.593
Ye Ping Jun's child isn't dead.

264
33:28.840 --> 33:32.840
That day at the hospital, it was Xie Zao Hua who took the child.

265
33:32.840 --> 33:33.986
Stop.

266
33:34.800 --> 33:37.914
It's so late. Where are you taking that child?

267
33:39.920 --> 33:41.780
What are you doing here?

268
33:42.720 --> 33:44.340
You know her, Madam Jiang?

269
33:45.760 --> 33:47.906
She used to be a servant at our house.

270
33:49.040 --> 33:51.160
No wonder she looked familiar.

271
33:51.160 --> 33:53.793
Well, off you go.

272
33:57.360 --> 34:02.080
By now she and the child should be in Nanhuai.

273
34:02.880 --> 34:06.780
Maybe they've already seen Yu Chang Xuan.

274
34:13.000 --> 34:14.466
Surprised?

275
34:21.880 --> 34:24.266
We've done too much wrong.

276
34:26.440 --> 34:31.080
If you truly love Ye Ping Jun, let her go.

277
34:31.960 --> 34:33.953
And set yourself free, too.

278
35:43.080 --> 35:46.319
Bo Ren, I hope this letter finds you well.

279
35:47.000 --> 35:51.030
My sister and I have decided to settle in Marseille for good.

280
35:51.030 --> 35:54.161
Before leaving, I looked back on the past.

281
35:54.161 --> 35:56.863
Only then did I realize

282
35:56.863 --> 36:01.412
I'd spent half my life caged by my own hatred.

283
36:01.412 --> 36:03.983
I once thought it was revenge.

284
36:03.983 --> 36:09.584
But it wasn't until Father died that I saw clearly, amid all the wreckage,

285
36:09.584 --> 36:14.800
the man I clung to for so long was a mirage.

286
36:14.800 --> 36:19.120
The one I truly loved was nothing but a dream.

287
36:19.120 --> 36:22.560
He never gave me a shred of his heart.

288
36:22.560 --> 36:24.720
But my jealousy

289
36:24.720 --> 36:29.520
burned me beyond recognition.

290
36:29.520 --> 36:32.139
Thank you for knocking some sense into me.

291
36:32.139 --> 36:37.346
You made me realize I shouldn't turn into someone even I despise.

292
36:38.120 --> 36:43.160
Now I'm leaving for a foreign land.

293
36:43.160 --> 36:47.920
I will try to find the proud Tao Zi Yi I once was,

294
36:47.920 --> 36:51.346
piece by piece.

295
36:53.760 --> 36:59.906
Bo Ren, for years to come, mountains and seas will stand between us.

296
37:00.760 --> 37:04.640
I only wish you a peaceful life ahead,

297
37:05.680 --> 37:07.626
and good fortune in your grasp.

298
37:09.599 --> 37:10.700
Zi Yi.

299
38:21.000 --> 38:22.724
You're Dr. Xie?

300
38:22.724 --> 38:25.280
Hello, Deputy Commander Yu.

301
38:25.280 --> 38:29.000
I'm Xie Zao Hua, Miss Ye's personal doctor.

302
38:31.320 --> 38:35.625
Where is she?

303
38:35.625 --> 38:39.906
I'm sorry. I couldn't get her out.

304
38:43.600 --> 38:48.120
This is your child. Yours and hers.

305
38:48.120 --> 38:51.753
His name is Yu Chong Ye.

306
38:52.440 --> 38:56.473
Miss Ye also gave him a nickname.

307
38:58.420 --> 38:59.780
Xiao Yu Er.

308
39:09.720 --> 39:11.446
Xiao Yu Er.

309
39:19.780 --> 39:21.519
These past two years,

310
39:26.679 --> 39:28.593
what has Ping Jun been through?

311
39:30.900 --> 39:34.739
Jiang Xue Ting kept her locked up in a small residence in Jiang City.

312
39:34.739 --> 39:37.713
He even threatened her with the child's life.

313
39:37.713 --> 39:41.259
She couldn't leave, nor could she escape.

314
39:41.920 --> 39:45.653
Miss Ye once had me send you a letter.

315
39:46.760 --> 39:52.573
But somehow, that letter just vanished.

316
39:53.440 --> 39:57.600
After Jiang Xue Ting found out I helped her,

317
39:58.440 --> 40:00.640
I was never allowed near her again.

318
40:02.080 --> 40:08.260
With Miss Tao's help, I snuck the child out of the hospital.

319
40:15.199 --> 40:17.193
Don't be scared, Xiao Yu Er.

320
40:20.880 --> 40:24.893
Xiao Yu Er, it's Daddy. Don't be afraid.

321
40:39.239 --> 40:42.480
Mr. Jiang, Commander Mou is asking for you.

322
40:48.739 --> 40:49.933
Xue Ting.

323
40:51.559 --> 40:57.106
No one in this world knows you like I do.

324
41:00.333 --> 41:02.177
What do you mean by that, Commander Mou?

325
41:02.177 --> 41:04.413
I know Fujiwara came to you,

326
41:05.560 --> 41:08.520
and I know the terms he offered.

327
41:08.520 --> 41:12.120
Knowing you, you'd never agree.

328
41:12.120 --> 41:13.960
You're a scholar.

329
41:13.960 --> 41:18.866
I know your so-called integrity all too well.

330
41:19.960 --> 41:24.928
Not only would you refuse, you'd run away.

331
41:24.928 --> 41:30.760
So you threw this banquet, Commander Mou, just to see me off?

332
41:30.760 --> 41:32.180
You're wrong.

333
41:34.280 --> 41:35.884
I'm keeping you here.

334
41:36.880 --> 41:41.493
If you run, the Japanese will pin it on me.

335
41:42.640 --> 41:44.020
So I'm sorry.

336
41:44.880 --> 41:49.026
Until you say yes to Fujiwara, you're not going anywhere.

337
41:49.680 --> 41:52.660
You'll just have to stay put with me.

338
41:55.221 --> 41:56.546
In that case,

339
42:00.000 --> 42:03.650
I'll never shake off the traitor label.

340
42:03.650 --> 42:06.293
You think your hands are still clean?

341
42:07.024 --> 42:08.735
From the first time

342
42:08.735 --> 42:14.693
you went to see Fujiwara, from your first political donation from them,

343
42:14.693 --> 42:18.953
from the moment you used that money to crush your rivals,

344
42:20.160 --> 42:21.861
you already were one.

345
42:23.200 --> 42:28.340
That was simply a fair exchange.

346
42:28.340 --> 42:30.013
What's the difference?

347
42:31.360 --> 42:37.766
In the world's eyes, you built your career on the Japanese.

348
42:38.940 --> 42:41.793
You're a traitor through and through.

349
42:42.640 --> 42:46.053
Xue Ting, stop fighting it.

350
42:47.840 --> 42:52.966
Cooperate with the Japanese, and you stay the illustrious Director Jiang.

351
42:54.080 --> 42:58.847
I know you hate me for forcing your hand.

352
43:00.840 --> 43:03.266
But one day you'll thank me.

353
43:04.332 --> 43:07.526
Think about the life you used to live.

354
43:08.377 --> 43:13.750
Look at you now, sitting here with the finest tableware,

355
43:13.750 --> 43:15.840
eating Kobe steak.

356
43:15.840 --> 43:20.113
Without me, Mou Lin Sen, where would you be today?

357
43:23.760 --> 43:24.900
Indeed.

358
43:27.240 --> 43:29.120
The tide has turned.

359
43:30.480 --> 43:32.766
One man can't hold it all back.

360
43:34.199 --> 43:36.006
Why not go with the flow?

361
43:38.680 --> 43:41.220
I'm glad you see it that way.

362
44:03.480 --> 44:06.120
If I hadn't met you, Commander Mou,

363
44:06.120 --> 44:10.680
I wouldn't be here today.

364
44:18.880 --> 44:21.126
I should also thank you, Commander Mou.

365
44:23.480 --> 44:26.633
If you hadn't fished me out of that dungeon,

366
44:27.640 --> 44:33.200
how would I end up like this,

367
44:33.200 --> 44:37.333
neither man nor ghost?

368
44:49.079 --> 44:51.006
Why are you doing this!

369
44:56.139 --> 45:01.780
You think I really don't know who did this to my leg?

370
45:02.450 --> 45:03.680
Brilliant, Commander.

371
45:03.680 --> 45:07.132
Jiang Xue Ting hangs on your every word, more obedient than a pet dog.

372
45:08.120 --> 45:12.627
He's consumed by hatred, bent on revenge against Yu Chang Xuan.

373
45:12.627 --> 45:14.719
That makes him the perfect tool.

374
45:14.719 --> 45:19.940
If he ever disobeys and bares his teeth at his master,

375
45:20.600 --> 45:22.580
I'll kill him myself.

376
45:24.240 --> 45:26.046
Has it ever occurred to you

377
45:26.820 --> 45:32.200
that your dog has been waiting for a chance

378
45:32.200 --> 45:35.290
to tear your throat out?

379
46:26.701 --> 46:28.940
Do as I say.

380
46:28.940 --> 46:30.000
Yes, sir.

381
46:50.960 --> 46:52.493
Welcome, Your Excellency.
